OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy imposter subjected
OL,4,Aex-professor and wife to 'terrifying
OL,5,Aordeal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn imposter who made headlines around
OL,8,Fthe world for posing as a school pupil
OL,9,Fin while in his 30s has appeared in
OL,10,Fcourt and admitted hiding in the home
OL,11,Fof his former university professor
OL,12,Fbefore subjecting him to a "terrifying
OL,13,Fordeal".
OL,15,FBrian MacKinnon targeted Prof Brian
OL,16,FWhiting, 87, as he lay in bed with his
OL,17,Fwife, the day after a BBC docudrama on
OL,18,Fhis ruse was broadcast.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
